ot involve peripheral vision (i.e., all conditions except the HDD), nor were there costs or benefits of auditory presentation of IVT information. Third, there did not appear to be any time costs of clutter (overlay) in detecting and responding to the critical events; however, there were increased collisions in overlay conditions for the initial, and therefore more surprising, incursion event.
Secondary Task Performance
